        },
        {
          "text": "Ocat-wil me lobo daŋ tye a koko kede kumo pire, pien ŋattoro mom dok wilo gin ame opoŋ i melgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.11",
